!/.nojekyll

# Private files, secrets and generated files at any depth.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
**/node_modules/
**/.cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
